		(descr "Dual-row 2x08 THT socket (2.54mm pitch, 12.7mm row spacing) for a Watterott-pattern TMC2209 SilentStepStick module, plus a 1x02 socket for the DIAG/INDEX breakout pins. Main header pinout/geometry verified against learn.watterott.com and the malloc-19/SilentStepStickKiCad reference PCB (16-pin header: pad pitch 2.54mm, row spacing 12.7mm). DIAG/INDEX pad-17/18 position below the main header is an approximate placement -- confirm against your physical module, or wire those two pins with short jumper leads instead of relying on this pad group to mate directly.")
